  "description": "Atmosphere management for crewed spacecraft: cabin pressure and composition control, carbon dioxide removal, oxygen generation via water electrolysis, trace contaminant control, and atmosphere monitoring. Maintains a breathable, shirtsleeve cabin environment at 101.3 kPa total pressure with 19.5-23.1 kPa oxygen partial pressure and CO2 below 0.7 kPa.",
